  "description": "This library is a WHOIS protocol client used to search owner information by IP address or domain name.\nThis library determines the WHOIS server automatically and queries the referral server recursively.\nThe response of the whois query contains strongly typed values, and the raw output.",
  "iconFile": "nupkg-icon.png",
  "id": "WhoisClient.NET",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2025-03-12T13:57:06.027Z",
